# Upfall Orchard (CIPlay upfall_orchard): a sky island 30 m up; the rim, the four apple baskets, the farmhouse chest,
# the well notice and the winch (signal roots: the plan's done-when, it brings Rootcellar Deep).
island Upfall Orchard
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Apples Fall Up
zone rim
expect step 1
read Orchard keeper's diary
expect step 2
use apple1
use apple2
use apple3
use apple4
expect story upapple 4
expect step 3
open Farmhouse chest
wait 3
expect step 5
read Well notice
expect step 6
use crank
expect story wellrope 1
expect done
